Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You replay one conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,picture five different outcomes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and somehow feel less certain than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.94,0:00:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,when you started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s overthinking: your mind\Nkeeps circling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,a problem after useful thinking\Nhas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One answer creates another\Nquestion, then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels productive because you’re\Nstill
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But more thought doesn’t always\Nbring
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,more clarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes the way forward isn’t\None
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,more possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s choosing what to do next.
